OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer Andy Ward
OL,8,FThe impact of this summer's hot and
OL,9,Fdry weather went up another notch this
OL,10,Fweek, with an official drought being
OL,11,Fdeclared across more than half of
OL,12,FEngland and most of Wales.
OL,14,FWith some parts of the UK having not
OL,15,Fseen a drop of rain for more than 40
OL,16,Fdays now, there are growing concerns
OL,17,Fthat food shortages and supermarket
OL,18,Fprice hikes could be on the way.
OL,20,FBut just how worried should we be? ITV
OL,21,FNews explains.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
