OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FCould spuds be off the menu?
OL,8,FIt may be stating the obvious, but
OL,9,Fmany of our favourite vegetables need
OL,10,Fwater to flourish - and plenty of it.
OL,11,FHowever, that's been in short supply.
OL,13,FAlthough most potatoes aren't
OL,14,Fharvested until the autumn, early
OL,15,Findications are that yields are likely
OL,16,Fto be down, GB Potatoes Chief
OL,17,FExecutive Scott Walker told ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FMr Walker also speculated that those
OL,7,Fthat do make it to supermarket shelves
OL,8,Fare likely to be smaller than normal,
OL,9,Fand potentially a bit more expensive.
OL,11,FShoppers will probably have to get
OL,12,Fused to seeing more "wonky spuds" on
OL,13,Ftheir dinner plates too, he added.
OL,15,FDespite the challenges, confidence is
OL,16,Fhigh among those working in the
OL,17,Findustry that severe shortages will be
OL,18,Favoided.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,F"While there are major challenges
OL,7,Fahead, the public can be assured that
OL,8,Fthere will continue to be British
OL,9,Fpotatoes available in the supermarkets
OL,10,Fand they will continue to offer
OL,11,Fincredible value, both in terms of
OL,12,Fcost and nutritional value," the
OL,13,Fpotato industry stakeholder group said
OL,14,Fin a joint statement.
OL,16,F"Consumers can be assured that great
OL,17,Ftasting British potatoes will remain
OL,18,Fon supermarket shelves."
OL,20,FOther household staples might be
OL,21,Fharder to find though.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
