OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FWhat other products are at risk?
OL,8,FMolly Monks, an insolvency expert at
OL,9,FNorth West-based firm Parker Walsh,
OL,10,Fwarned that certain products we all
OL,11,Ftake for granted, like pasta, bread
OL,12,Fand cereal, could soon be in short
OL,13,Fsupply.
OL,15,F"For now, it looks like produce such
OL,16,Fas carrots and onions will be hit the
OL,17,Fhardest as a result of dry soil
OL,18,Fshrinking crop sizes," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,F"Salad crops may also be impacted and
OL,7,Fare likely to be the first replaced by
OL,8,Fpricier imports, if necessary, due to
OL,9,Fthe amount of irrigation required to
OL,10,Fgrow them.
OL,12,F"Even cupboard staples which are often
OL,13,Fviewed as relatively wallet-friendly
OL,14,Fcould see a price rise as wheat and
OL,15,Fbarley crops come under heat stress."
OL,17,FAnd it's not just crops feeling the
OL,18,Fheat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FMilk production is down 20% across the
OL,7,FUK, about 18.5 million litres, as cows
OL,8,Fstruggle to keep cool and well-fed due
OL,9,Fto a lack of grass.
OL,11,F"Just like humans, when cows are
OL,12,Fstruggling to be comfortable, their
OL,13,Fproductivity reduces," Professor
OL,14,FNicola Cannon, from the Royal
OL,15,FAgricultural University (RAU) in
OL,16,FCirencester, said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FThe Royal Association of British Dairy
OL,7,FFarmers told ITV News that reduced
OL,8,Fmilk production had "tightened
OL,9,Fsupplies" but stopped short of saying
OL,10,Fthat it would translate into higher
OL,11,Fsupermarket prices.
OL,13,FWhen could shoppers notice a
OL,14,Fdifference?
OL,16,FRegardless of what the rest of the
OL,17,Fsummer has in store, the damage may
OL,18,Falready have been done.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FThe Bank of England admitted on
OL,7,FThursday that food inflation is set to
OL,8,Frise again later this year, as supply
OL,9,Fissues linked to hot, dry weather have
OL,10,Faffected prices for shoppers.
OL,12,FIt comes hot on the heels of a warning
OL,13,Ffrom the Environment Agency last week
OL,14,Fthat the hot weather is already
OL,15,Faffecting food production - leaving
OL,16,Fmany farmers with no choice but to
OL,17,Fstart their harvests early.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FAnd with yields almost certain to be
OL,7,Flower than normal, supermarkets may
OL,8,Fhave to source more produce from
OL,9,Foverseas instead.
OL,11,F"Shoppers may not notice price hikes
OL,12,Fimmediately, but if the hot and dry
OL,13,Fweather continues, they could notice
OL,14,Fit within a couple of months," Monks
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,F"Larger supermarket chains will want
OL,18,Ffull, healthy crops, and if they can't
OL,19,Ffind it on home soil, they may begin
OL,20,Fto import produce from abroad.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,F"Certain crops and produce items will
OL,7,Fstart to be imported if it becomes
OL,8,Fnecessary, and the cost of that will
OL,9,Flikely be passed down to the customer."
OL,11,FSupermarkets are hopeful it won't come
OL,12,Fto that, though.
OL,14,F"Extreme weather, including drought,
OL,15,Fcan affect crop yields and place
OL,16,Fupward pressure on prices," said
OL,17,FAndrew Opie, Director of Food &
OL,18,FSustainability Policy at the British
OL,19,FRetail Consortium.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,F"Retailers are experienced in managing
OL,7,Fsupply disruptions and will take all
OL,8,Fnecessary steps, including sourcing
OL,9,Ffrom alternative suppliers where
OL,10,Fappropriate, to minimise any impact on
OL,11,Fcustomers."
OL,13,FCould wine producers be toasting a
OL,14,Fsuccessful summer?
OL,16,FIt's not all bad news though,
OL,17,Fespecially if you like a glass of red
OL,18,For white.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FLast year's hot, dry summer saw wine
OL,7,Fproduction in England and Wales surge
OL,8,Fby 55% compared to the year before -
OL,9,Fmaking it the second-largest harvest
OL,10,Fon record in the UK.
OL,12,FWine GB, the official trade
OL,13,Fassociation and national body for the
OL,14,FEnglish and Welsh wine industry, told
OL,15,FITV News it was "optimistic" that this
OL,16,Fyear would be just as good, if not
OL,17,Fbetter, but stressed it was too early
OL,18,Fto say for sure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785530891
OL,3,CUK drought: How could it affect your
OL,4,Cfood shop?
OL,6,FAnd it's not just wine production that
OL,7,Fis benefiting from the hot spell. In
OL,8,FLondon, bananas are growing "in
OL,9,Fabundance" at the Rockingham Estate in
OL,10,FElephant and Castle.
OL,12,FBut anyone hoping to try one might be
OL,13,Fleft disappointed.
OL,15,F"You can eat the bananas, but they're
OL,16,Fnot tasty," Winston Miller, the
OL,17,Fgardener at the Rockingham Estate,
OL,18,Ftold ITV News London.
OL,20,F"I've never eaten one myself - but
OL,21,Fapparently they're quite sour!"
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
